msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid ""
"The recovery parts (or Recovery Key) of your old kits will stop working. "
"Print the new kit right after, and keep each part in a different place."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1416
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Issue new parts"
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1429
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Renew the vault key?"
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1430
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid ""
"The vault gets a new key, a new Secret Key and a new kit; the master "
"password stays. The old kit, the old Secret Key and every older copy of the "
"file (a backup, a stolen copy) stop opening it, and what changes from now on "
"is out of their reach. Each of your other devices asks once for the new "
"Secret Key. Print the new kit right after."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1431
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Renew the key"
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1453
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Change the unlock protection?"
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1454
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid ""
"The vault's password lock is written again with {}. Your items stay as they "
"are; every device that opens the vault then needs that much memory and time "
"per unlock. Windows Hello turns off until you turn it on again."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1455
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Apply"
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1479
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Make a keyfile?"
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1480
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Use another file as the keyfile?"
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1481
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Remove the keyfile?"
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1482
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid ""
"A new file with a random key is written where you choose, and from then on "
"the vault opens only with your master password and that file. Keep a second "
"copy apart from it: losing it locks you out. Windows Hello turns off until "
"you turn it on again."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1483
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid ""
"Any file that never changes, not even by one byte, can be the keyfile: from "
"then on the vault opens only with your master password and that file. Keep a "
"copy apart from it. Windows Hello turns off until you turn it on again."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1484
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid ""
"The vault opens with your master password alone again. The file itself is "
"left where it is. Windows Hello turns off until you turn it on again."
msgstr ""

