#: ui/app.slint:1505
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid ""
"This computer stops syncing and forgets its key for the server (or the "
"WebDAV password). The copies already there stay, and your other devices keep "
"syncing. You can join again later."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1506
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid ""
"It leaves the vault's list of devices: every device refuses its copies from "
"its next sync, and its copy and key leave the server. It keeps only what it "
"already had, which opens only with your master password and Secret Key. It "
"can join again later as a new device, with a new invite."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1507
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid ""
"The server makes an invite that works once, for an hour: a QR code to scan "
"on the phone, or a line to paste on another computer. Whoever has it can put "
"a sealed copy of the vault on that device; it opens only with your master "
"password and Secret Key."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1508
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid ""
"This computer stops syncing through it and forgets its key there. Its copy "
"there is left, and the main place goes on as before."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:1509
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid ""
"It can't ask for logins any more until it is connected again, which asks for "
"the master password and the code its window shows."
